    comment: "Vuelve a calcular el CRC-32 de\ncada trama: si coincide, la deja\npasar\
      \ sin los 4 bytes del CRC;\nsi no, la descarta (ten\xEDa\nerrores).\nEntra:\
      \ bytes: payload + CRC (L +\n  4).\nSale: bytes: payloads correctos\n  (L bytes\
      \ cada uno)."
    lengthtagname: '"packet_len"'
    maxoutbuf: '0'
    minoutbuf: '70000'
    packed: 'True'
  states:
    bus_sink: false
    bus_source: false
